About Klaas Puul 
Klaas Puul BV has been one of the leading producers of fresh fish products in Europe for decades. From catch to delivery to the customer, Klaas Puul manages the entire production and processing process. Thanks to our high-standard production system and authentic craftsmanship, we offer the very highest quality in shrimp. Want to work at an organisation recognised for its success? Klaas Puul is among the finalists of the Noord-Holland Entrepreneurial Election 2026, a wonderful confirmation of our ambition.,, 
What are you going to do 
As a Financial Administrator, you ensure that our financial records are processed fully, promptly and accurately. You are a key link within the finance department and work closely with your colleagues to ensure that financial data is reliable and reports are available on time. 
In addition to your daily administrative duties, you will assist with month-end and year-end closings and actively contribute ideas on improving and streamlining processes. Furthermore, you will be involved in: 
Processing and checking purchase invoices; 
· Managing accounts payable and accounts receivable, including sending reminders and formal notices; 
· Monitoring outstanding items and payment terms; 
Processing bank transactions and cash flows; 
- Checking and maintaining general ledger and sub-ledgers; 
· Assisting with month-end, quarter-end and year-end closes; 
